# Opelucid City (a city that keeps its past and builds its future side by side): a proud trumpet tune in E minor over strings, a harp
# arpeggio like a slow clock, a walking bass and a restrained beat. At night a horn takes the tune, slower. Original
# composition for this game (plan 22 · U8, part a).
